    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banana Ragdoll is a game where you can run and look at Bananas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all 3 levels and get achievements for them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 levels in the game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level 1 - insane obstacle course platformer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level 2 - sandbox for physics experiments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level 3 - mountains from which you can fall epically in slowmotion*</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Slowmotion is available on any of the levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics, Obviously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cool music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are interested to know what other levels you would like to see in the game and we will be happy to add them in the updates.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banana Ragdoll is a game where you can run and look at Bananas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all 3 levels and get achievements for them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 levels in the game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level 1 - insane obstacle course platformer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level 2 - sandbox for physics experiments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level 3 - mountains from which you can fall epically in slowmotion*</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Slowmotion is available on any of the levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics, Obviously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cool music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are interested to know what other levels you would like to see in the game and we will be happy to add them in the updates.</p>",
